 776:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c **** 
 777:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****     /*
 778:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * Traverse limbs and
 779:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * - adapt byte-order in each limb
 780:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * - swap the limbs themselves.
 781:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * For that, simultaneously traverse the limbs from left to right
 782:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * and from right to left, as long as the left index is not bigger
 783:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * than the right index (it's not a problem if limbs is odd and the
 784:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * indices coincide in the last iteration).
