1214:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * Calculate l - r where l and r have the same size.
1215:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * This function operates modulo (2^ciL)^n and returns the carry
1216:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * (1 if there was a wraparound, i.e. if `l < r`, and 0 otherwise).
1217:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *
