1389:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c **** /** Helper for mbedtls_mpi multiplication.
1390:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *
1391:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * Add \p b * \p s to \p d.
1392:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *
1393:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * \param i             The number of limbs of \p s.
1394:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * \param[in] s         A bignum to multiply, of size \p i.
1395:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      It may overlap with \p d, but only if
1396:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      \p d <= \p s.
1397:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      Its leading limb must not be \c 0.
1398:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * \param[in,out] d     The bignum to add to.
1399:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      It must be sufficiently large to store the
1400:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      result of the multiplication. This means
1401:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      \p i + 1 limbs if \p d[\p i - 1] started as 0 and \p b
1402:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *                      is not known a priori.
1403:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * \param b             A scalar to multiply.
