1557:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * A->p[n - 1] * b / b == A->p[n - 1], then A * b fits in the same
1558:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * number of limbs as A and the call to grow() is not required since
