1561:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * calls to calloc() in ECP code, presumably because it reuses the
1562:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * same mpi for a while and this way the mpi is more likely to directly
1563:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * grow to its final size. */
