1993:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *
1994:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * This is functionally equivalent to mbedtls_mpi_copy(R, T[idx]) except it
1995:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * reads the entire table in order to avoid leaking the value of idx to an
1996:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * attacker able to observe memory access patterns.
